WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.070
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.350 --> 01:24.080
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:36.090 --> 01:37.620
Yes, I've passed it!

01:37.900 --> 01:39.090
Naoya, we're free.

01:39.630 --> 01:41.500
There is a bigger world over here.

01:42.130 --> 01:44.500
We can go anywhere now.

01:44.740 --> 01:45.670
Nothing is scary.

01:46.440 --> 01:47.230
Come on!

01:47.310 --> 01:48.140
Yeah.

01:55.680 --> 01:57.310
Brother, over there...

02:00.590 --> 02:01.890
<i>Touch</i>

02:01.890 --> 02:05.910
<i>Episode 2
Touch</i>

02:25.640 --> 02:26.610
Welcome...

02:28.810 --> 02:29.970
What's wrong?

02:30.350 --> 02:32.480
You can sit wherever you want.

02:33.850 --> 02:35.410
Actually, our car got a flat tire.

02:35.790 --> 02:36.720
A flat?

02:44.830 --> 02:46.300
How about 30,000 yen?

02:47.200 --> 02:50.170
I'm saying I'll fix it
for you for 30,000 yen.

02:50.400 --> 02:52.460
Isn't 30,000 yen a little expensive?

02:52.540 --> 02:53.870
Under any circumstances...

02:53.940 --> 02:56.240
Is it something you need
to stick your head into?

02:56.310 --> 02:56.860
No...

02:58.640 --> 03:01.240
That's fine. Fix it for us, please.

03:03.280 --> 03:04.340
Yeah!

03:13.520 --> 03:14.720
Advance payment.

03:26.570 --> 03:28.540
Stupid, the keys!

03:29.310 --> 03:30.270
Yeah...

03:32.410 --> 03:33.470
Where's the car?

03:34.010 --> 03:37.500
It's parked about
100 meters down the road.

03:41.590 --> 03:44.820
Come on, you can sit
wherever you would like to.

03:45.120 --> 03:45.680
Yeah...

04:07.410 --> 04:09.940
These days people know
there is a trick to that.

04:10.180 --> 04:11.380
Brother...

04:21.530 --> 04:22.720
What do you want?

04:26.160 --> 04:28.930
Is this boy okay? Maybe he
has a fever or something?

04:30.200 --> 04:31.330
Wh-What!

04:32.570 --> 04:34.370
Please don't touch him.

04:34.570 --> 04:35.400
Huh?

04:36.010 --> 04:39.310
Two ginger ales and a mix pizza.

04:44.250 --> 04:45.550
Put your hand out.

04:45.850 --> 04:46.870
Ah, yes...

04:52.890 --> 04:55.450
You are going out
with an older woman.

04:55.790 --> 04:56.990
H-Hold on!

04:57.730 --> 05:00.030
You're being spoiled by that person.

05:00.400 --> 05:02.490
H-Hold on for a second!

05:02.570 --> 05:04.470
Don't say random things!

05:04.540 --> 05:07.470
No, I was just speaking the truth.

05:07.540 --> 05:08.030
What!

05:08.510 --> 05:11.770
I know about a person
when I touch them.

05:15.910 --> 05:19.440
Your blushing face is the evidence.

05:19.620 --> 05:21.520
Th-That can't be.

05:21.590 --> 05:23.750
To be able to know just by touching...

05:24.090 --> 05:25.320
That's right, that's right!

05:25.390 --> 05:28.590
If you were able to know about people
like that, there'd be no trouble.

05:28.730 --> 05:31.060
You wouldn't have to
have any court trials.

05:31.400 --> 05:34.420
I want that kind of power
if it really exists.

05:34.770 --> 05:35.460
Why?

05:35.670 --> 05:40.260
Because you'd know if the other person
really likes you or not right away.

05:40.370 --> 05:41.670
It's really useful, isn't it?

05:51.820 --> 05:53.980
Stop watching such a stupid show!

05:57.220 --> 06:01.780
I hate people that say such things
like supernatural powers exist!

06:09.170 --> 06:12.100
Calm down, Jin-chan. It's only TV.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.540
Hey, old man Tagawa.

06:20.110 --> 06:21.440
Wh-What's up?

06:22.080 --> 06:25.110
You were the one that wanted to
watch this crappy show, right?

06:28.750 --> 06:32.020
Hey, I heard from somewhere...

06:32.360 --> 06:37.230
...that the other day you went to
consult a famous fortune-teller?

06:38.930 --> 06:41.870
About your daughter's
engagement or something...

06:43.870 --> 06:47.170
Apparently they told you not to
put anything on that's purple?

06:47.540 --> 06:48.600
Idiot!

06:48.710 --> 06:51.140
Why are you paying 50,000 yen
for something like that!

06:51.310 --> 06:53.300
What's wrong with you, old man!

06:53.380 --> 06:56.110
Jin-chan, come here and sit down.

06:58.020 --> 06:59.810
What the hell are supernatural powers!

06:59.880 --> 07:03.820
If there is an idiot that believes
something like that exists in this world...

07:03.890 --> 07:05.860
...they should come
right here in front of me!

07:05.990 --> 07:08.390
There isn't an idiot
like that here, is there?

07:09.930 --> 07:10.690
Ow!

07:10.760 --> 07:11.520
Don't look!

07:14.270 --> 07:16.760
If supernatural powers actually exist...

07:16.830 --> 07:19.890
...then show it to me
right in front of my eyes, stupid!

07:21.440 --> 07:23.200
Stop. It's so stupid.

07:23.270 --> 07:25.330
Jin, why don't you stop it?

07:29.010 --> 07:29.840
I'm sorry!

07:33.020 --> 07:34.250
Please forgive your mother.

07:34.420 --> 07:35.510
I'm sorry!

07:35.950 --> 07:37.750
Let me out of here!

07:42.530 --> 07:46.930
Are you the ones that brought
Naoya and me to a place like this?

07:58.240 --> 07:59.330
We were abandoned...

08:00.310 --> 08:02.400
We were abandoned by our parents!

08:02.910 --> 08:04.970
It's only Naoya and me now.

08:05.250 --> 08:06.980
We were abandoned!

08:08.720 --> 08:09.320
Brother...

08:09.320 --> 08:10.410
Brother...
Damn it!

08:10.960 --> 08:12.980
I'm not going to hold it in anymore!

08:34.180 --> 08:35.410
Damn it!

08:35.580 --> 08:37.210
What is there!

08:41.390 --> 08:43.550
What's going on! Damn it!

08:44.020 --> 08:46.650
Why can't we get through! Why!

08:47.220 --> 08:48.490
Damn it!

08:56.700 --> 08:57.670
Brother.

08:58.640 --> 08:59.630
What?

09:00.040 --> 09:01.230
Don't get mad.

09:01.540 --> 09:02.560
I know.

09:04.380 --> 09:06.610
Hey, you right there! Hey!

09:12.850 --> 09:15.010
What's up with your face?

09:15.950 --> 09:16.820
Hey!

09:17.490 --> 09:18.850
I-I'm sorry.

09:18.920 --> 09:19.790
M-My brother isn't feeling...

09:19.790 --> 09:21.020
M-My brother isn't feeling...
You stay sitting!

09:23.890 --> 09:26.420
Bring me closer to the truth of heaven!

09:27.970 --> 09:29.330
Bring me closer to the truth of heaven!
What is that!

09:29.400 --> 09:30.260
Salt.

09:32.540 --> 09:35.470
It's precious salt that has lots of
master's thought put into it.

09:36.170 --> 09:37.400
Sit down properly!

09:37.910 --> 09:41.940
How much money are you putting
into that freaking belief of yours?

09:42.180 --> 09:44.370
Money doesn't just
come from nowhere!

09:44.520 --> 09:46.210
I'm the one that's earning
that money with these hands!

09:46.280 --> 09:47.910
Mom, what are you doing!

09:50.390 --> 09:51.360
Mom!

09:51.420 --> 09:54.650
Mom, that's the company's money!
You can't, Mom!

09:54.730 --> 09:55.450
Let go!

09:55.530 --> 09:56.460
You devil!

10:10.310 --> 10:12.300
Wh-What are you...

10:28.330 --> 10:28.920
Are you okay?

10:39.700 --> 10:40.930
Brother, stop.

10:46.180 --> 10:47.940
You guys all know, right?

10:48.150 --> 10:50.340
That my mother is missing...

10:53.650 --> 10:55.980
A story like that spoils everything.

10:58.520 --> 11:01.960
My mother went somewhere
with the cult leader.

11:02.360 --> 11:06.390
He was really good at bending spoons
and seeing through things.

11:06.700 --> 11:08.820
It was all a fraud!

11:08.930 --> 11:11.230
If you were able to do such a thing,
no one would ever have trouble in life!

11:11.300 --> 11:12.530
We wouldn't need the police!

11:13.070 --> 11:16.230
Murders wouldn't happen! Idiots!

11:22.250 --> 11:24.710
There's no way
supernatural powers exist.

11:24.820 --> 11:26.840
We all know that, right?

11:27.150 --> 11:28.550
O-Of course.

11:28.950 --> 11:32.150
I have an acquaintance that
used to work at the TV station.

11:32.420 --> 11:35.550
And they helped out at a TV show
about supernatural powers.

11:35.830 --> 11:36.790
For real?

11:36.860 --> 11:37.760
Really?

11:38.000 --> 11:39.930
There's a trick to everything.

11:40.030 --> 11:42.790
Apparently the audience
was in on it too.

11:43.830 --> 11:45.360
That's kind of horrible, isn't it?

11:45.540 --> 11:48.030
TV is something like that, right?

11:48.470 --> 11:51.200
Seeing through is
something you can easily fake.

11:51.280 --> 11:54.710
That's why I said such
a thing doesn't exist.

11:55.250 --> 11:57.740
But if supernatural powers
really did exist...

11:57.820 --> 12:01.680
...I would beat up people
that I didn't like so easily.

12:03.720 --> 12:04.520
What?

12:05.360 --> 12:07.950
Are you even listening to what I'm saying?

12:08.430 --> 12:09.220
Idiot!

12:11.700 --> 12:13.160
You're so stupid.

12:13.600 --> 12:15.500
S-Seriously, I'm so stupid.

12:15.570 --> 12:17.160
Punch. Just kidding...

12:21.370 --> 12:22.930
B-But, Jin-kun...

12:23.340 --> 12:24.200
What?

12:24.480 --> 12:28.070
Just because the cult leader
and people that are on TV are fake...

12:28.150 --> 12:31.080
...doesn't mean that everything
in the world is fake. That's what I think.

12:32.320 --> 12:33.410
Tagawa...

12:35.020 --> 12:37.280
J-Jin-chan, not here, okay?

12:40.560 --> 12:41.650
Say it one more time!

12:41.930 --> 12:43.590
P-Please let go of me...

12:59.680 --> 13:00.940
It's done.

13:01.510 --> 13:03.410
Master, I totally forgot.

13:03.910 --> 13:06.580
Hey, there was that show on
supernatural powers just now, right?

13:07.080 --> 13:08.810
Isn't that real?

13:08.890 --> 13:11.350
I have this feeling that it is...

13:14.330 --> 13:15.660
Wh-What? What happened?

13:15.730 --> 13:18.320
You are unlucky, you idiot!

13:22.670 --> 13:24.070
You bastard!

13:33.510 --> 13:34.480
Cut it out!

13:40.820 --> 13:42.410
What did you say?

13:43.050 --> 13:44.210
I told you to cut it out.

13:44.690 --> 13:45.420
What?

13:50.430 --> 13:51.220
Cut it out!

13:53.500 --> 13:55.090
What did you say?

13:55.730 --> 13:57.260
I told you to cut it out.

13:57.330 --> 13:58.030
What?

14:11.250 --> 14:12.340
Watch carefully.

14:12.680 --> 14:14.380
I will show it right in front of you.

14:26.730 --> 14:29.160
Brother, let's just leave, okay?

14:30.200 --> 14:30.930
Yeah...

14:41.250 --> 14:42.180
Wait a second!

14:44.880 --> 14:46.080
Don't underestimate me!

14:49.450 --> 14:51.790
You think you won
against me, damn it?

14:52.090 --> 14:53.850
You think you're done already?

14:53.960 --> 14:57.620
Do you want an entrance fee
for your talent show or something?

15:13.180 --> 15:13.940
Brother...

15:14.580 --> 15:15.310
Let's go.

15:15.780 --> 15:16.970
How stupid!

15:18.220 --> 15:20.180
Jin, what's up with you too?

15:20.450 --> 15:22.510
You know there is a trick to this.

15:22.620 --> 15:25.350
These guys are trying
to make fun of us!

15:26.120 --> 15:29.180
Ah, I get it! It's a switching trick!

15:29.290 --> 15:30.350
I was almost fooled.

15:30.890 --> 15:32.020
A switching trick?

15:32.200 --> 15:34.060
Why do I have to do such a thing?

15:35.700 --> 15:38.500
Why would we know
what a coward does, right?

15:38.840 --> 15:41.430
That's right. Fraud! Bogus! Fake!

15:51.780 --> 15:53.480
There has to be a trick!
I won't be fooled!

16:07.900 --> 16:09.460
It's psychokinesis!

16:09.570 --> 16:13.230
Amazing! To think I got to
see it right in front of me!

16:18.740 --> 16:20.400
Are you a person with
supernatural powers too?

16:22.450 --> 16:24.310
What kind... what kind of powers?

16:25.050 --> 16:26.040
Reading?

16:26.120 --> 16:27.910
A touch-telepath kind of thing?

16:28.550 --> 16:30.080
What the hell is reading?

16:30.450 --> 16:32.650
They are able to read inside
the heart of another person.

16:32.720 --> 16:36.220
They take their thoughts and emotions
from contact with their skin.

16:41.300 --> 16:42.490
You bastard!

16:43.400 --> 16:44.590
Brother, don't use it!

16:52.080 --> 16:54.570
I told you I wouldn't let you
go if you're screaming...

16:54.650 --> 16:56.610
...supernatural powers
or whatever, idiots!

17:00.920 --> 17:02.250
Reading, huh?

17:03.090 --> 17:04.850
Hey, touch this guy.

17:10.930 --> 17:11.830
Don't!

17:11.900 --> 17:13.020
Please don't!

17:14.330 --> 17:15.160
Brother!

17:23.340 --> 17:24.170
No...

17:25.980 --> 17:27.340
Cute face.

17:38.590 --> 17:40.420
Keep it a secret from Jin-chan.

17:46.630 --> 17:48.290
This'll be bad if Yuri finds out.

17:53.200 --> 17:55.230
Isn't 30,000 yen a little expensive?

17:55.310 --> 17:56.700
Under any circumstances...

18:07.720 --> 18:08.550
Stop it.

18:08.620 --> 18:09.520
Stop it now!

18:11.690 --> 18:12.950
Naoya, get it together!

18:13.220 --> 18:14.620
Hey, are you okay?

18:17.490 --> 18:18.790
Wh-What was that?

18:19.200 --> 18:21.660
What? I was able to see it just now.

18:22.230 --> 18:23.430
What was that just now?

18:23.500 --> 18:26.090
Hey Yoko-chan, what was
with what I saw just now?

18:30.440 --> 18:32.030
What was with that just now?

18:32.340 --> 18:33.500
Hiroko!

18:34.580 --> 18:36.840
Brother... Brother, help me!

18:37.280 --> 18:38.680
E-Everyone here right now is...

18:39.780 --> 18:40.480
Lies!

18:42.420 --> 18:45.650
Jin-san, it's a misunderstanding!
I didn't have sex with Hiroko!

18:45.720 --> 18:46.750
You idiot!

18:48.090 --> 18:50.360
Naoya's reading caused this woman's...

18:50.430 --> 18:52.830
...wave of consciousness
to be caught by everyone.

18:52.960 --> 18:53.930
What?

18:56.600 --> 18:58.530
D-Don't say such an absurd thing!

18:58.600 --> 19:00.230
I-It's a fraud!

19:00.300 --> 19:02.240
You guys are liars!

19:02.340 --> 19:04.000
Get out of here immediately!

19:10.050 --> 19:11.140
You bastard!

19:14.150 --> 19:15.480
Stop it!

19:23.730 --> 19:24.660
My head...

19:38.380 --> 19:39.270
Stop it!

19:39.480 --> 19:40.440
Brother, no more!

19:40.810 --> 19:41.840
Brother!

20:02.170 --> 20:02.960
We're leaving!

20:04.400 --> 20:05.160
Out of the way!

20:44.110 --> 20:45.170
Naoya...

20:48.210 --> 20:49.270
Monster!

21:06.360 --> 21:08.730
Those two... What did you see?

21:09.300 --> 21:13.130
The two of them were trying
to murder a young woman...

21:13.800 --> 21:14.900
I was so scared.

21:16.510 --> 21:18.200
The negative powers...

21:18.540 --> 21:20.010
Being drawn to it, huh?

21:34.190 --> 21:36.590
<i>Futami</i>

21:39.630 --> 21:40.600
Shouko...

21:40.900 --> 21:43.460
Shouko, where have you gone off...

21:55.710 --> 21:56.540
What?

21:56.610 --> 21:58.310
I want you to hold on to this.

21:58.550 --> 21:59.640
Why?

22:00.480 --> 22:03.510
Tonight, two brothers will escape.

22:13.500 --> 22:17.260
Miki, please hold on to that
notebook with great care.

22:18.970 --> 22:20.530
Two brothers...

22:29.910 --> 22:38.720
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:47.560
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

22:47.630 --> 22:56.400
<i>A single shadow looked like light
in this world that I'm imprisoned in.</i>

22:56.470 --> 23:05.210
<i>The rain of May became lighter
as it was kindly shining tomorrow.</i>

23:05.280 --> 23:09.620
<i>I lost the meaning of smiling...</i>

23:09.690 --> 23:13.990
<i>... that day I thought I
lost my place to be.</i>

23:14.060 --> 23:18.430
<i>I wished for your warmth.</i>

23:18.500 --> 23:22.930
<i>We have stopped time.</i>

23:23.170 --> 23:27.260
<i>I had this feeling it was
eventually going to come, but...</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:31.900
<i>... I pretended I didn't know
and buried my loneliness.</i>

23:31.980 --> 23:42.080
<i>I looked down at your feet as the
droplets describing "Good-bye" fell.</i>

23:42.720 --> 23:51.460
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

23:51.530 --> 23:59.900
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

24:01.140 --> 24:04.570
The negative attracts the negative.
The negative affinity.

24:05.480 --> 24:09.910
The repulsive intent to murder
that is born from obsession.

24:10.610 --> 24:12.780
The keyword is purple.

24:13.580 --> 24:17.580
And the girl that disappeared
leaving mysterious words.

24:18.690 --> 24:22.280
Something has started moving
somewhere we don't know.

24:23.460 --> 24:29.860
<i>Episode 3, "Impatience"</i>

24:26.260 --> 24:29.300
Where are we headed?
